# Review a build

Read the `review-build` skill. You are not rubber-stamping your own work.

## House stops

- Ground truth is `git status` / `git diff`, not session memory.
- Quote gate command output. Blockers and majors get fixed.
- Isolated checker (`reviewer` or `/review`) on a large diff — same-context
  self-grade cannot close.
- Edits unstaged. No commit/push/PR unless asked.
